年熊本地震に係る地震保険の事故受付件数（2026年7月31日現在）を公表しました。\n事故受付件数：40,291件\n詳細は以下からご覧ください。\nhttps://t.co/MZq3qH0fz4","id_str":"2089579223673680153","is_quote_status":false,"lang":"ja","possibly_sensitive":false,"possibly_sensitive_editable":true,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":4,"retweeted":false,"user_id_str":"1747895030294171648"},"note_tweet":{"is_expandable":true,"note_tweet_results":{"result":{"entity_set":{"hashtags":[{"indices":[224,227],"text":"地震"},{"indices":[228,233],"text":"地震保険"},{"indices":[234,239],"text":"損害保険"},{"indices":[240,243],"text":"損保"},{"indices":[244,248],"text":"保険金"},{"indices":[249,254],"text":"損保協会"}],"smarttags":[],"symbols":[],"urls":[{"display_url":"sonpo.or.jp/news/release/2…","expanded_url":"https://www.sonpo.or.jp/news/release/2026/a5663v00000084vc-att/260818_01.pdf","indices":[75,98],"url":"https://t.co/uCHG64t4D3"}],"user_mentions":[]},"id":"Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjIwODk1NzkyMjM1NTYxODYxMTI=","richtext":{"richtext_tags":[]},"text":"令和8年熊本地震に係る地震保険の事故受付件数（2026年7月31日現在）を公表しました。\n事故受付件数：40,291件\n詳細は以下からご覧ください。\nhttps://t.co/uCHG64t4D3\n災害後は、「保険金請求を代行する」・「保険金請求をサポートする」・「保険で直せる」などと言って勧誘する業者と保険契約者とのトラブルが増加します。このような勧誘があってもすぐに契約はせずに、まずはご加入先の損害保険会社または代理店にご相談ください。\n\n＃地震 ＃地震保険 ＃損害保険 ＃損保 ＃保険金 ＃損保協会"}}},"rest_id":"2089579223673680153","source":"<a href=\"https://mobile.twitter.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Twitter Web App</a>","unmention_data":{},"views":{"count":"3084","state":"EnabledWithCount"}}}},"user_id_str":"276848601"},"rest_id":"2090408602066723055","source":"<a href=\"https://mobile.twitter.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Twitter Web App</a>","unmention_data":{},"views":{"count":"649","state":"EnabledWithCount"}}}}}},"entryId":"tweet-2090408602066723055","sortIndex":"2090514194834128893"},{"content":{"__typename":"TimelineTimelineItem","clientEventInfo":{"component":"suggest_organic_list_tweet","details":{"timelinesDetails":{"injectionType":"OrganicListTweet"}},"element":"tweet"},"entryType":"TimelineTimelineItem","itemContent":{"__typename":"TimelineTweet